    <string name="stash_category_wechat_env_hint">Send only works in a WeChat chat: turn on the accessibility service and keep WeChat open on the chat you want to send to. Sending overwrites any draft in the input box. On some devices or WeChat versions accessibility cannot read the WeChat screen (an empty node tree); you will get a message and the content is copied to the clipboard instead. Try turning on “Select to Speak” in the system accessibility settings so WeChat rebuilds its view tree, then retry.</string>

